{"id":"n25706-1-7","stage":2,"title":"부대 · 部队","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n25706-1-7-1","ko":"민준이랑 승규는 서로 친한가 보구나.","zh":"敏俊和承奎看起来很熟。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"민준이랑","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词。；랑：连接并列名词，表示“和”。","readings":[{"term":"민준이랑","audio":"/audio/51fe8c7e5b3a50dbeb63.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"민준이랑","audio":"/audio/51fe8c7e5b3a50dbeb63.mp3"}},{"text":"승규는","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"승규는","audio":"/audio/8cca37774e5e7081db86.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"승규는","audio":"/audio/8cca37774e5e7081db86.mp3"}},{"text":"서로","meaning":"互相，相互","explanation":"서로：互相，相互","readings":[{"term":"서로","audio":"/audio/fbeb53408bcf7039778f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66374","senseId":"1","lemma":"서로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"서로","audio":"/audio/fbeb53408bcf7039778f.mp3"}},{"text":"친한가","meaning":"亲近，要好，亲密","explanation":"친하다：亲近，要好，亲密；ㄴ가：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"친하다","audio":"/audio/0275722d7b511a470593.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"80614","senseId":"1","lemma":"친하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"친한가","audio":"/audio/d81e0ffee1f4ab6dcfc0.mp3"}},{"text":"보구나.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보구나","audio":"/audio/63677854531485540e78.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"fbeb53408bcf7039","term":"서로","zh":"互相，相互","audio":"/audio/fbeb53408bcf7039778f.mp3","entryId":"66374","definition":"两个以上缔结关系的对象相对于各自的对方。","pronunciation":["서로"]},{"id":"0275722d7b511a47","term":"친하다","zh":"亲近，要好，亲密","audio":"/audio/0275722d7b511a470593.mp3","entryId":"80614","definition":"近交相知，感情深厚。","pronunciation":["친하다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/8180a00f7cc2e4d3f02a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n25706-1-7-2","ko":"군대에 있을 때 같은 부대에 있었거든요.","zh":"他们服兵役时在同一个部队。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"군대에","meaning":"部队，军队","explanation":"군대：部队，军队；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"군대","audio":"/audio/05ea65477ab09b876055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60101","senseId":"1","lemma":"군대","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"군대에","audio":"/audio/3c5d6ec0fda95e5323a2.mp3"}},{"text":"있을","meaning":"在，待，住","explanation":"있다：在，待，住；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"9","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있을","audio":"/audio/e77f5d4b360ff618b52e.mp3"}},{"text":"때","meaning":"时，时候","explanation":"때：时，时候","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"1","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}},{"text":"같은","meaning":"相同，一样，一致","explanation":"같다：相同，一样，一致；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"1","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같은","audio":"/audio/9dce73570f65f8a11961.mp3"}},{"text":"부대에","meaning":"部队","explanation":"부대：部队；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"부대","audio":"/audio/bd979a65da618ebbd1b5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25706","senseId":"1","lemma":"부대","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"부대에","audio":"/audio/aaed4b2c682c10162ecd.mp3"}},{"text":"있었거든요.","meaning":"在，待，住","explanation":"있다：在，待，住；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；거든요：礼貌地补充理由或背景。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"9","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있었거든요","audio":"/audio/0c92c664893e341a72b7.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"05ea65477ab09b87","term":"군대","zh":"部队，军队","audio":"/audio/05ea65477ab09b876055.mp3","entryId":"60101","definition":"具有一定的规律和秩序的军人的集体。","pronunciation":["군대"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"在，待，住","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物停留或居住在某个地方。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"43bc9c47e0f938b1","term":"때","zh":"时，时候","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3","entryId":"74123","definition":"指某一瞬间或时间段。","pronunciation":["때"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"相同，一样，一致","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"彼此并无差异。","pronunciation":["갇따"]},{"id":"bd979a65da618ebb","term":"부대","zh":"部队","audio":"/audio/bd979a65da618ebbd1b5.mp3","entryId":"25706","definition":"有组织的军人集团；或指军人集团停留的设施。","pronunciation":["부대"]}],"audio":"/audio/1a5bd09d4e49c96a0f72.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.705,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=25706","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":89,"sequenceScore":2.4303,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["他们服兵役时在同一个部队。","眼睛怎么红成那样了？","敏俊和承奎看起来很熟。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["他们服兵役时在同一个部队。","敏俊和承奎看起来很熟。","眼睛怎么红成那样了？"],"answer":0}]}
